<Base title="About CalcSolver.info" description="Learn about CalcSolver.info, a free browser calculator with clear math guides and activities."><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>About</span></nav><h1>About CalcSolver</h1><p class="page-lead">A small tool for the numbers in your day.</p><div class="article-body"><h2>Our idea is simple</h2><p>Math tools should be easy to reach and easy to understand. CalcSolver.info brings together a browser calculator, short mathematical guides and activities for a little break between questions.</p><h2>Useful from the first click</h2><p>Use the calculator without signing up or installing an app. Calculations run on your device. Our guides show the method as well as the answer, so you can check your work and learn something along the way.</p><h2>A little more to explore</h2><p>Code Mode opens a collection of activities. Enter 0000 to see the directory, or enter a four-digit activity number to open it directly. The local 2048 and Snake games run on this website; other activities load from external providers.</p><h2>About this domain</h2><p>This website is operated at calcsolver.info. It is a separate website from services using other CalcSolver domain names.</p></div><div class="calculator-cta"><span>Ready to work something out?</span><a href="/#calculator">Open the calculator →</a></div></div></Base>
